    "updated_at": "2016-11-30T16:46:17Z",
    "body": "If we add #1290, it will become convenience. However, if we want to abstract the element and the track representation, as far as I know, it's impossible to do efficiently.\r\n\r\nFWIW, both Gecko and Blink have an internal `readyState` being used for `TextTrack` so I would assume finding a value for script-created and in-band tracks to be a solved issue (didn't check what they do but likely created as loaded).",
