    "body": "Yes, 'loaded' would be the reasonable value for non-HTMLTrackElement sourced tracks. It's speced already too - https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#sourcing-in-band-text-tracks step 6, https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#dom-media-addtexttrack step 2.",
